=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  menu-layout config-menu --------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Adopted 2026-11-14: no Figma frame. Main menu 8: hardn.yml,$
# DNS, NTP, Syslog. Kernel Settings is main menu 4.$
$
# Configuration ################################################$
$
   1) hardn.yml            View or edit the file hardn reads$
   2) DNS Settings         Configure nameservers$
   3) NTP Settings         Keep the clock in sync$
   4) Syslog Settings      Send logs to a syslog server$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-4 or q]:$
$
$

